2BE","slideTitle":"スライド #62","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"私は、慌てて彼について行こうとすると、彼の手がぶつかる。\n私はあのときドキッとし、そして、口走り、そのまま走り出す。","title":"シーン 62","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_古明地こいし.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":11.539773242630385,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":10.744195011337869,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.063.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"BE80F333-55F0-402B-84BA-1806AEB8618C","slideTitle":"スライド #63","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"だが、さらに1kmがたつと、今度は足元にある石ころにこける。\nそして、次の瞬間には、彼に抱っこされていた。","title":"シーン 63","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_063_古明地こいし.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":10.744195011337869,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":10.158548752834466,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.064.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"89A19C83-5DDA-4670-BC1F-4F4A922EE30D","slideTitle":"スライド #64","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"それからだろうか…、私は、今までの学校生活では全くと言っていいほど、感じなかった気持ちが心から湧き出していた。","title":"シーン 64","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_古明地こいし.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":10.158548752834466,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":3.1171201814058955,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.065.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"070982B2-A2EE-422B-AF1B-0C1A33A61DCA","slideTitle":"スライド #65","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"私は、ふと意識が現実に戻ると、彼が困った表情で、私の名前を読んでいた。「私は…紅夢と…」私は、続けて言葉を放つ。","title":"シーン 65","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_古明地こいし.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":3.1171201814058955,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":5.495396825396825,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.066.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"A7937E5D-A9EE-4B36-B857-D75214AC9D98","slideTitle":"スライド #66","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"「こいし…、一体どんな変化があったのよ…」\n私は、妹が発した予想外なその言葉に、そう返す。","title":"シーン 66","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地さとり","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_古明地さとり.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":5.495396825396825,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":8.010430839002268,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.067.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"4339F70B-A57E-448D-B81E-3380B9058333","slideTitle":"スライド #67","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"僕は、こいしの発言に驚きながらも、念の為に、他の二人に確認をとる。「それで、部屋割りはどうしますか？」","title":"シーン 67","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":8.010430839002268,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":6.72047619047619,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.068.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"52D7225E-841E-4F2E-A195-502ED77F1BB0","slideTitle":"スライド #68","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"「あの…、もしこいしさんと紅夢さんが同じ部屋になるのなら、私との約束は、どうなるのかしら…。」私は、そう彼に聞く。","title":"シーン 68","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":6.72047619047619,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":8.773469387755101,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.069.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"8C4EF519-A7A6-4257-A5EC-BB1BE8BF8A37","slideTitle":"スライド #69","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"僕は、アリスのその指摘で思い出す。「確かにそうですね…」\n僕は、そう言いながら、考える。だが、くしゃみが再び出る。","title":"シーン 69","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":8.773469387755101,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":3.456077097505669,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.070.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"AAF832E5-9D67-4574-96BE-4E1CB11B9288","slideTitle":"スライド #70","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"「今日の昼食は、各自で準備でも構いませんか？」","title":"シーン 70","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_070_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":3.456077097505669,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":7.054580498866213,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.071.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"2406EB0D-A3A2-434A-AFD7-E8B449957B54","slideTitle":"スライド #71","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"「それで、構いませんよ。とりあえず、紅夢さんの、風邪を治すのが、先ですし…、ただこいしの発言にも…答えてくれますか？」","title":"シーン 71","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地さとり","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_071_古明地さとり.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":7.054580498866213,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":7.756077097505669,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790\/元女子校の日常　第19話_37b78f5790.072.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"15402D32-2770-4E0B-BDAB-7C322FD122BA","slideTitle":"スライド #72","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","telop":"「じゃあ、誰と寝るかは、夕食後に決めるとして、とりあえず今は、僕とこいしさん、さとりさんとアリスさんでいいですか？」","title":"シーン 72","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":7.756077097505669,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0},{"duration":1.3111337868480726,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】